    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκοπ-έω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέψομαι</span>: aor. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσκεψάμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>view closely, spy out, reconnoitre</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὅποι</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1607
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀγγελλόμενα</span>
			<i>reconnoitre</i>, Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				23.10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ πῃ</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.1.39
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.50
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πολεμίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; <i>keep a look-out</i>, of ships, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.95.6
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπεῖσθαι ἑαυτήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					2.1.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὸς ἑαυτὸν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>MM</u>
					1213a5
				</span></i>
			; <i>inspect</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πανοπλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					10.20.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1414.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; of a medical examination, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				1.293
			</span></i>.</div>
